<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were mostly steady to weak. Demand and movement were moderate. Top $47.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  46.00-47.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  41.00-46.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  36.00-41.00</p>
<p>Sows - near steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 45.00-49.00</p>
</text>
